{"unit_id":"YuChenLiao__dsh-plugin-structured-prompt#card-zh","repo":"YuChenLiao/dsh-plugin-structured-prompt","commit":"2b82acd41367a74f0b1765a64d216172a69c29e1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Structured Prompt 是面向 Web 客户端的提示词构建插件，提供结构化表单、模型可调用的构建工具和公开提示词检索。表单与工具共用同一套构建逻辑，可用模板填充身份、目标、规则、工具策略、输出格式、数据不足处理和示例，并支持自动填充、导入导出、复制或发送成稿。构建工具可选将提示词交给子代理；提示词库可搜索 prompts.chat 并预览、发送原文。适合希望规范提示词编写或复用公开提示词的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API 密钥；库检索默认连接 prompts.chat。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/components/structured/host/build.ts:25-51","src/components/structured/host/tool.ts:188-220","src/components/library/host/library.ts:114-151","src/components/structured/client/ui/ModalFooter.tsx:54-120"]}
{"unit_id":"YuChenLiao__dsh-plugin-structured-prompt#card-en","repo":"YuChenLiao/dsh-plugin-structured-prompt","commit":"2b82acd41367a74f0b1765a64d216172a69c29e1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Structured Prompt builds prompts from a form or model tool and searches a public prompt library. Users can apply templates, auto-fill fields, import or export forms, then copy or send prompts. The tool can delegate to a subagent. Library results can be previewed and sent. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/components/structured/host/build.ts:25-51","src/components/structured/host/tool.ts:188-220","src/components/library/host/library.ts:114-151","src/components/structured/client/ui/ModalFooter.tsx:54-120"]}
